ComfyUI-fni8
Copyright 2026 fni8 authors

int8 dp4a (sm_70 / Volta) acceleration for diffusion DiTs in ComfyUI.

This project integrates with ComfyUI (https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI,
GPL-3.0) as a custom-node package via its public node/ops-patch API; it does not
modify or redistribute ComfyUI. The ops-patch integration approach follows the
precedent set by ComfyUI-GGUF (city96, Apache-2.0). It depends on the sibling
`fni8` kernel library (BSD-3-Clause) for the dp4a GEMM, the bidirectional int8
FlashAttention, and the .fni8 weight format.

Diffusion model architectures (Flux, SD3, Qwen-Image, Z-Image, Wan, LTX, etc.)
are the property of their respective authors; this package only accelerates their
inference — it ships no model weights.
